			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="2" y="335" width="527" height="72" uuid="ce4daaa1-2844-455c-959c-44aea1292913"/>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Verdana"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Dear Sirs,

With reference to our cargo arrival notice and subsequent reminders to you to clear the consignment, we regret to inform you that the consignment remains unclaimed till date for reasons best known to you.
]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="2" y="488" width="527" height="216" uuid="391ed7f6-8ed4-4aa5-bd44-8cd31075c13d"/>
				<textElement>
					<font fontName="Verdana"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[We therefore strongly urge you to take delivery immediately without further delay and will hold you fully responsible for all costs and consequences.

We specifically remind you that the Carrier has fulfilled its obligations under the terms of the Bill of Lading/Sea WayBill and that the cargo remains at the wharf/terminal at your full risk, exposure and expenses. The Carrier shall not be liable for any damages or loss whatsoever caused due to this unreasonably long idling of container(s)/cargo.

If we do not receive any positive response from your office within 7 days of receipt of this letter, we shall reserve the right to initiate proceedings with the concerned authorities for permission to destuff the cargo, and retrieve our container. All relevant costs in this connection will be debited to your account.

Should you wish to discuss this matter or require any further information, please contact our office as a matter of priority.

Yours faithfully,]]></text>
			</staticText>
